-node=3D"17,0,0"><b data-path-to-node=3D"17,0,0" data-index-in-node=3D"0">A=
tomic Acquisition:</b> The <code data-path-to-node=3D"17,0,0" data-index-in=
-node=3D"24">UPDATE ... WHERE</code> query prevents two people from grabbin=
g the lock at once.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=3D"17,1,0"><b data-pat=
h-to-node=3D"17,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"0">Fencing:</b> Even if a client=
 "lags" and tries to save after their lock expired and was taken by someone=
 else, the <code data-path-to-node=3D"17,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"111">fe=
ncingToken</code> check will fail.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=3D"17,2=
,0"><b data-path-to-node=3D"17,2,0" data-index-in-node=3D"0">Idempotency:</=
b> If the network fails and the client retries, the <code data-path-to-node=
